  "description": "The beautiful girl Sun Xiaofei has been single for many years, and she always wants to have a boyfriend. One day she accidentally bumps into a young, handsome CEO who happens to be on his first day to assume office in her company. What will happen to them? Will a romantic encounter and a kiss appointment a perfect beginning for Sun Xiaofei's new love story...\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/67994380), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=13412084) \n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[S.Chinese](https://www.iqiyi.com/manhua/detail_18yzmexojp.html)",
